            <doc>This is the total amout of matter in white dwarves, neutron stars and black holes from when the big stars go supernova.</doc>
            <eqn>0 {NS&amp;BH}</eqn>
            <inflow>Star_Matter_from_Supernovas_2</inflow>
            <display x="571" y="591" color="black" label_angle="117" />
